okc-kernels: third-party notices
================================

The code in this repository was written for the Open Kernel Challenge (OKC) 2026, except for the segments
listed below, which were copied or adapted from other projects. Each such segment is marked in place in the
source with SPDX-SnippetBegin / SPDX-SnippetEnd comments giving its source, copyright, license and our
changes. Full license texts are in LICENSES/. Diff files (change.diff, and diffs under evidence/) show code
from the builds and so also contain these segments; their attribution is the one marked in the builds.
Each problem's tools/ folder, and copies of its files elsewhere, come from the OKC problem starter.

